{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2018b.q30.material.recovered", "text": "案例： 高一（2）班的女生晓芳和小敏同学是好朋友，晓芳上周休病假，刚到学校就遇上体育课。在课的上半段进行耐久跑时，晓芳觉得头晕、胸口憋闷、呼吸急促、下肢沉重，有一种不想坚持跑下来的感觉，但在小敏的鼓励下还是跑到了终点。在课的下半段进行蛙跳练习时，晓芳的积极性不高，而小敏却超额完成了老师安排的练习要求。 第二天上学的路上，晓芳问小敏：“昨天我在跑步时，特别特别难受，不知为什么？”小敏说：“今天早上我的腿酸痛酸痛的，都不敢走路，也不知道为什么？”……", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2018年下半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "9ada265a27b28686afdbb06e634da6172211ce9a569c3dce88dc67627ea70980", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2671, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2896, "next_source_question_number": 40, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2018年下半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 30, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "9ada265a27b28686afdbb06e634da6172211ce9a569c3dce88dc67627ea70980"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2018b.q30"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.s1.k01", "ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.s1.k04", "ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.s1.k11"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.413.r003", "ntce.outline.413.r005", "ntce.outline.413.r008", "ntce.outline.413.r011", "ntce.outline.413.r030"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2018b.q30"], "word_count": 225, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "tiyu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2018年下半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2018年下半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "9ada265a27b28686afdbb06e634da6172211ce9a569c3dce88dc67627ea70980", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2671, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2896, "next_source_question_number": 40, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2018年下半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "r